#
# Above: winoracle (WARP, Windows 11, D3D11 runtime) x64 at FEATURE_LEVEL_11_0,
# verbatim. The x86 build prints the same lines except the four
# "setprivatedatainterface" lines, which report size=4 (pointer size).
# `./a04_x64.exe max` (FL 12_1) differs only in: caps (TiledResourcesTier=2,
# ConservativeRasterizationTier=3), rs1 forced=1 ms=1 and forced=16 accepted,
# and rs2 conservative=1 (+forced=1, +aa=1) accepted.
#
# Verdicts against the Vitreo build of 2026-09-27 23:22 (x64 and x86 identical):
